# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Applied at the edge to every response
# served from the publish root (the main SPA on orangerails.com, the connect
# flow on connect.orangerails.com, and the docs.* host).
#
# Scope note: this file sets framing and content hardening headers only. It does
# NOT set a script/style/frame Content-Security-Policy. A restrictive script-src
# needs a full inventory of every origin the app talks to (Supabase, Quiltt, the
# stealth block source, analytics) plus QA, or it silently breaks the SPA. That
# is deliberately left as a separate follow up.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
